      "html": "<div id=\"step-q59864\" class=\"step questionWidget\" stepid=\"q59864\" questionid=\"59864\" format=\"MC\" answer=\"\" current=\"false\" style=\"display: block;\"><div class=\"questionWidget-header\"><div class=\"questionWidget-title\">Question 2</div><div class=\"questionWidget-helpButton\">?</div></div><div class=\"questionWidget-text\"><p>Gerry, a gardener, is planting roses. He knows he needs <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"36\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> cup of water for every <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"37\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> seeds he plants. So, Gerry creates a ratio table to determine the ratio of water to seeds for different quantities.</p>\n<br><p></p><table align=\"center\" font-size=\"inherit\" width=\"250px\" style=\"border: 1px solid black\" rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"5\">\n\n<tbody><tr style=\"height: 45px;\">\n        <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align:center\">    Water (cups)    </th>\n        <th bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align:center\"> Seeds  </th>\n</tr>\n\n<tr style=\"height: 40px;\">\n        <td width=\"50%\" style=\"text-align:center;\">    <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctx